{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_08A800","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Snake，好久不见……。听说你在尼加拉瓜闹出了不小的动静。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":80,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"我这边还是老样子。“贤者的遗产”似乎正在被“有效利用”……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"不过……这次我有些话想对你说。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"随信附上的照片，你看到了吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"十年前，The Boss把它托付给了我……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":50,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"对不起，一直瞒着你。也许我本来应该立刻告诉你的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"可是这十年来，我也一直在犹豫，到底该不该把它交给你。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"等你听完我接下来要说的事，大概就会明白原因。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"随信附上的那张照片……是她的遗物。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"你一定会想，这有什么特别的？毕竟这张照片在报纸和杂志上也经常能看到。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":102,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"没错，照片上是“Original 7”——美国最初的宇航员，水星计划的英雄。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":94,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"但这张照片原本拍下的是八个人。第八个人的身影被干干净净地抹掉了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"那个通过修图连存在本身都被抹去的第八名宇航员……就是她，The Boss。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":95,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"为什么The Boss的存在必须被隐藏起来？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":50,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"政府甚至不惜修改照片也要掩盖的，究竟是什么？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"要说明这件事，就必须追溯到17年前……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":56,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"冷战时期，东西方不仅在核武器上竞争，也在争夺太空开发技术。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"1957年，苏联发射了世界第一颗人造卫星“斯普特尼克1号”。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":80,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"美国民众大为震惊。此前，他们一直天真地相信<R=本国,AMERICA>的科学技术是世界最先进的。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=本国,AMERICA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":120,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"这份震惊，同时也化作了恐惧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":20,"cn_text":"发射人造卫星所需的火箭技术，同样可以直接转用到核导弹上。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":21,"cn_text":"美国也慌忙认真投入到太空开发之中。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":22,"cn_text":"第二年，陆军成功发射了美国第一颗人造卫星“探险者1号”。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":82,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":23,"cn_text":"到了秋天，<R=美国国家航空航天局,NASA>成立，水星计划也正式启动。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=美国国家航空航天局,NASA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":24,"cn_text":"为了把人类送上太空……七名男子被选为宇航员候选人。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":25,"cn_text":"他们被称为“Original 7”，被奉为国家英雄、也被塑造成西方太空开发的<R=象征,ICON>。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=象征,ICON>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":112,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":26,"cn_text":"但在“探险者”之后，美国的火箭发射接连失败。焦急的政府于是做出了一个决定。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":111,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":27,"cn_text":"不能再等美国的太空开发技术成熟。去窃取苏联的技术，同时破坏他们的太空计划。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":111,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":28,"cn_text":"我想，你自己最清楚那是多么艰巨的<R=任务,MISSION>。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=任务,MISSION>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":29,"cn_text":"苏联的太空开发，被厚厚的机密之墙包围着。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":30,"cn_text":"想取得那些情报，绝非易事。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":31,"cn_text":"必须先在研究机构内部争取协力者，再送入<R=潜伏特工,SLEEPER>；或者干脆把协力者本人培养成潜伏特工……。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=潜伏特工,SLEEPER>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":144,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":32,"cn_text":"必要时，还必须亲自潜入其中，打开突破口。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":33,"cn_text":"这需要知识、经验，以及出色的直觉……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":34,"cn_text":"而被选中执行这项任务的人，正是The Boss。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":56,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":35,"cn_text":"听说是总统亲自点名选中了她。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":36,"cn_text":"他们大概认为，能被托付这种赌上祖国命运的<R=任务,MISSION>，只有那位大战英雄。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=任务,MISSION>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":108,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":37,"cn_text":"那是1959年6月。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":20,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":38,"cn_text":"没错，The Boss之所以从你面前消失，正是为了执行这项绝密<R=任务,MISSION>。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=任务,MISSION>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":98,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":39,"cn_text":"可这项人事安排惹恼了CIA。他们不满总统越过自己直接下令。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":40,"cn_text":"任务本就极其困难，CIA却不愿配合她，既不提供人员，也不提供情报。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":41,"cn_text":"在孤立无援的处境中，The Boss做出了一个决定——一个伴随着巨大风险的决定。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":104,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":42,"cn_text":"那就是利用“贤者们”的网络……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":43,"cn_text":"而从那一刻起，命运的齿轮开始转动……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""}]}